----------- test code
assert_equal [Shoes::Button, Shoes::EditLine, Shoes::EditBox, Shoes::ListBox, Shoes::Progress, Shoes::Check, Shoes::Radio],
  $controls.map(&:class), "the seven native controls, one creation method each"
